{"title": "Ichorous Corrosion", "pageid": 28962, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ichorous_Corrosion", "categories": ["Damage Rider As Source", "Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Ichorous Corrosion</b> is a passive feature that applies noxious fumes on the user's targets when the user deals acid damage to them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the wearer deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage, they also inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Noxious Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Condition)\">Noxious Fumes</a> on the target(s). \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Noxious_Fumes\"> Condition: Noxious Fumes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Noxious Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Condition)\">Noxious Fumes</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save (DC&nbsp;13)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;13)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Hostile creatures in a radius of 3 m (10 ft) take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a><abbr title=\"Damage Rider As Source\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">DRS</a></abbr> damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ichorous_Gloves\" title=\"Ichorous Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ichorous_Gloves\" title=\"Ichorous Gloves\">Ichorous Gloves</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Ichorous Corrosion is not triggered by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fleshmelter_Cloak\" title=\"Fleshmelter Cloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fleshmelter_Cloak\" title=\"Fleshmelter Cloak\">Fleshmelter Cloak</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Despite the description stating it affects <i>targets</i>, Ichorous Corrosion only applies once per turn and thus only affects one target.\n<ul><li>It also does not mention that it only has a <i>chance</i> to apply Noxious Fumes.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202931\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2549/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26437/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7876/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 852190/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   56.869      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   56.869      1 -total\n 26.70%   15.184      5 Template:Icon_text\n 26.44%   15.035     31 Template:Trim\n 25.28%   14.377      4 Template:Icon_link\n 21.15%   12.028      2 Template:DamageType\n 18.29%   10.404      1 Template:Condition\n 17.10%    9.723      9 Template:Ifempty\n 16.10%    9.155      2 Template:Item_icon\n 15.04%    8.554      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28962-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202931 and revision id 372570. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}